# GitHub personnel
# ==========================================

Host github.com-personal
    HostName github.com
    User git
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_github_personal
    IdentitiesOnly yes
    AddKeysToAgent yes
    UseKeychain yes


